%%{init: {"theme": "redux-color"}}%%
sequenceDiagram
    actor Customer as Customer
    participant UI as Service Ride Interface
    participant Service as Application Service
    participant Records as Service Ride Records
    Customer->>UI: Submit the verification code
    UI->>Service: Submit account verification request
    Service->>Records: Check code match and expiration
    Records-->>Service: Return current records and validation result
    alt Request satisfies the business rules
        Service->>Records: Activate email verification
        Records-->>Service: Confirm the saved or calculated result
        Service-->>UI: Display the verified account status
        UI-->>Customer: Display the result and next step
    else Request needs correction or review
        Service-->>UI: Reject an expired or mismatched code
        UI-->>Customer: Display the reason and required action
    end
